<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>账号管理 · Kestrel Studio</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/logo.svg">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/main.css">
</head>
<body class="admin-page">
  <header class="topbar">
    <a class="brand" href="/">
      <img class="brand-logo" src="/logo.svg" alt="" width="32" height="32">
      <span class="brand-name">Kestrel Studio</span>
    </a>

    <nav class="menu">
      <a class="menu-button" href="/">返回对话</a>
      <a class="menu-button" href="/admin/conversations">全站会话</a>
    </nav>

    <div class="account">
      <div class="account-menu">
        <span class="account-name">{{user.username}}</span>
        <form action="/logout" method="post" class="logout-form">
          <button type="submit" class="logout-button">退出登录</button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="admin-main">
    {{#if notice}}
      <p class="admin-notice{{#if notice.isError}} admin-notice-error{{/if}}">{{notice.text}}</p>
    {{/if}}

    {{! Plain POST + redirect, like /login: no client script runs on this page. }}
    <section class="admin-card">
      <h2 class="admin-title">新建账号</h2>
      <p class="admin-hint">
        新账号一律是普通用户，只能看到自己的会话。用户名 3-32 位字母、数字、下划线或短横线，密码至少 6 位。
      </p>
      <form class="admin-form" action="/admin/users" method="post">
        <label class="admin-field">
          <span>用户名</span>
          <input name="username" type="text" required autocomplete="username">
        </label>
        <label class="admin-field">
          <span>密码</span>
          <input name="password" type="password" required autocomplete="new-password">
        </label>
        <button type="submit" class="admin-button">创建</button>
      </form>
    </section>

    <section class="admin-card">
      <h2 class="admin-title">账号（{{accounts.length}}）</h2>
      <table class="admin-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>账号</th>
            <th>角色</th>
            <th>会话</th>
            <th>资产</th>
            <th>创建时间</th>
            <th></th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {{#each accounts}}
            <tr>
              <td class="admin-account-name">{{this.username}}</td>
              <td>{{this.roleLabel}}</td>
              <td><a href="/admin/conversations?user={{this.id}}">{{this.conversationCount}}</a></td>
              <td>{{this.assetCount}}</td>
              <td>{{this.createdAtLabel}}</td>
              <td><a href="/admin/users/{{this.id}}">管理</a></td>
            </tr>
          {{/each}}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
